OL,3,APrisoner took his own life after terror
OL,4,Aorder had 'substantial impact' on
OL,5,Amental state, inquest finds
OL,6,
OL,7,FA prisoner took his own life after
OL,8,Fstrict terrorism control measures
OL,9,Fimposed by the government had a
OL,10,F"substantial impact" on his mental
OL,11,Fstate, an inquest jury has concluded.
OL,13,FAkhtar Uddin, 35, a builder from east
OL,14,FLondon, died in HMP Wandsworth on
OL,15,FChristmas Day 2021 after being jailed
OL,16,Fthe previous year for breaching
OL,17,FTerrorism Prevention and Investigation
OL,18,FMeasures (TPIM).
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
