OL,3,APrisoner took his own life after terror
OL,4,Aorder had 'substantial impact' on
OL,5,Amental state, inquest finds
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe jury at Inner West London Coroner's
OL,8,FCourt also found the prison service had
OL,9,Ffailed to provide the support that
OL,10,FUddin needed.
OL,12,FJurors concluded that Uddin died due to
OL,13,Fan action he took but said that it was
OL,14,F"not possible to determine whether he
OL,15,Fintended the outcome to be his death".
